			Text: Quiet zone
		Paragraph: The quiet zone is part of the size of the code: 10 modules on each side of a Code 128 by default. `Quiet zone` sets another number, from 0 to 40. In a box of the same width, a smaller zone leaves wider bars. The background shows where the zone is.
